  help: invalid length `64-128px`: use a number with px, rem, em or %, such as 16px or 1.5rem
note[QD007] 14:15: 2 tokens aren't used by Quill: Obsidian --color-obsidian Dark section b…, --color-highlighter
  help: These are fine to leave in. Quill's templates just have no place for them.
note[QD020] 26:5: `Lausanne` isn't bundled with Quill, so IBM Plex Sans is used instead, the substitute the file lists
  help: Quill never loads fonts from other servers. If you have a license, install the font on your site separately.
note[QD040] 31:1: applied the rule “A single weight (400) forces hierarchy through size and tracking rather than weight contra…”: heading weight is now 400
note[QD020] 33:5: `Berkeley Mono` isn't bundled with Quill, so JetBrains Mono is used instead, the substitute the file lists
  help: Quill never loads fonts from other servers. If you have a license, install the font on your site separately.
note[QD040] 55:1: applied the rule “No box-shadow on anything. Borders do the elevation work.”: shadows are off
note[QD040] 86:3: applied the rule “Never bold.”: heading weight is now 400
note[QD041] 87:3: this rule wasn't applied: “Use photography of real people, never illustrations.”
note[QD041] 88:3: this rule wasn't applied: “Keep sentences short.”
note[QD030] -: dark palette derived from the light one: bg #0e0d0c, surface #171615, text #d3d0ce, muted #81807f, border #2a2927, accent fill #e4f14d, accent text #e4f14d
  help: Add dark tokens to the file to set these yourself.

name: Some("Northwind Exchange")
fonts: ["ibm-plex-sans", "jetbrains-mono"]
origins: text:61 bg:62 accent_fill:11 muted:13 surface:21 border:22 radius:64 page_width:66

@font-face { font-family: "IBM Plex Sans"; src: url("/blog/static/fonts/ibm-plex-sans-latin-wght-normal.woff2") format("woff2"); font-weight: 100 700; font-style: normal; font-display: swap; }
@font-face { font-family: "JetBrains Mono"; src: url("/blog/static/fonts/jetbrains-mono-latin-wght-normal.woff2") format("woff2"); font-weight: 100 800; font-style: normal; font-display: swap; }

:root {
  --bg: #f4f2f0;
  --surface: #ffffff;
  --text: #0c0a08;
  --muted: #6d6c6b;
  --border: #e5e7eb;
  --accent-fill: #e4f222;
  --on-accent: #0c0a08;
  --accent-text: #0c0a08;
  --code-bg: #ffffff;
  --font-body: "IBM Plex Sans", system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  --font-heading: "IBM Plex Sans", system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  --font-mono: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  --heading-weight: 400;
  --radius: 16px;
  --measure: 40rem;
  --shadow: none;
}

@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --bg: #0e0d0c;
    --surface: #171615;
    --text: #d3d0ce;
    --muted: #81807f;
    --border: #2a2927;
    --accent-fill: #e4f14d;
    --on-accent: #0e0d0c;
    --accent-text: #e4f14d;
    --code-bg: #151412;
  }
}

:root {
  --design-font-ui: "IBM Plex Sans", system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  --image-radius: 16px;
  --title-weight: 400;
}

body.width-regular, body.width-wide { --page-width: 1200px; }
